[Event "Knight School"]
[Opening "Vienna Game"]
[Variation "Vienna Game: Vienna Gambit, 3...Bb4"]
[ECO "C25"]
[Character "tactical"]
[Risk "medium"]
[EarlyMate "none"]
[Tricks "fork,trap"]
[Themes "double-attack"]
[Refutes "1. e4 e5 2. Nc3 Nf6 3. f4 Bb4"]
[For "white"]
[Kind "for-us"]
[Opponent "3...Bb4"]
[Start "1. e4 e5 2. Nc3 Nf6 3. f4"]

3... Bb4 $2 { Pins the knight on c3, but the pin does not stop White taking on e5 with a pawn that attacks Black's knight. } 4. fxe5 { Takes the pawn and kicks the knight. } 4... Bxc3 5. bxc3 { Recaptures; the knight on f6 is still attacked. } 5... Nxe4 6. Qg4 { A double attack: the queen hits the knight on e4 and the pawn on g7. White is a pawn up with more to come. } 6... Ng5 7. d4 { Builds the centre and chases the knight again. White has an extra pawn and the open f-file against the king. } *
